ghts Cyan, and hit the next black key - D#.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775585546533","neuronKeys":[],"edgeStrings":["[#e3a8c]_#_[#d1a66]","[#d1a66]_#_[#3535d]","[#d1a66]_#_[#6cf10]"],"description":"The middle distance will make SpikerBot sing an F# and light up green.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775585597437","neuronKeys":["[#e205c]"],"edgeStrings":["[#e3a8c]_#_[#e205c]","[#e205c]_#_[#3535d]","[#e205c]_#_[#6cf10]"],"description":"Closer still will trigger yellow light, and a G# note.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775585641585","neuronKeys":["[#bb948]"],"edgeStrings":["[#e3a8c]_#_[#bb948]","[#bb948]_#_[#3535d]","[#bb948]_#_[#6cf10]"],"description":"Finally if we nearly touch SpikerBot as close as we can, it will glow orange and play the note A#.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775585733240","neuronKeys":[],"edgeStrings":["[#9eb09]_#_[#6cf10]","[#b0b91]_#_[#6cf10]","[#d1a66]_#_[#6cf10]","[#e205c]_#_[#6cf10]","[#bb948]_#_[#6cf10]"],"description":"You can set each note to any value you want in two different octaves, and pick between different instrument voices. Some will sustain, and others will pluck the notes. Pick a different instrument or scale and try to play your favorite song!","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775585823064","neuronKeys":["[#d1a66]"],"edgeStrings":["[#e3a8c]_#_[#d1a66]","[#d1a66]_#_[#6cf10]"],"description":"If you don’t have enough notes to play your song, you can adda new path from the distance sensor to the speaker output with a quiet neuron. If you have too many notes, you can also remove them from your instrument!","thumbnail":""}],"info":{"title":"Sharp Note Theremin","description":"Play music just like a theremin using the distance sensor and the black piano keys!","author":"User","version":"1.0.1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T16:00:09.899008"}}